#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J4.0b/index.html:0
msgid "Is a 4-digit spoken passcode the right balance of security and ease for this family?"
msgstr "对这个家庭而言，口头说出的 4 位通行码是否在安全与便利之间取得了恰当的平衡？"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "Is a family wallet a national service, a private app, or both — and who decides which apps may hold a record?"
msgstr "家庭钱包是国家服务、私营应用，还是两者兼有——由谁决定哪些应用可以保存记录？"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j2-found-at-home/index.html:0
msgid "Is added to his household: the Onesan health system now knows he exists."
msgstr "被加入他的家庭：奥内萨卫生系统现在知道他的存在了。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/walkthrough/J2a/index.html:0
msgid "Is an “unverified but recorded” vaccine useful to the next clinician — or a risk?"
msgstr "一剂“未验证但已记录”的疫苗，对下一位临床医生是有用的信息，还是一种风险？"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "Is born, and gets his Hep B and BCG birth doses within hours."
msgstr "出生，并在几小时内接种乙肝（Hep B）和 BCG 出生剂次。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "iss SHALL be optional and SHALL be encoded as a text string. When present, the issuer SHALL require two upper-case letters, the alpha-2 form used in iss and in the DSC's X.509 C attribute."
msgstr "iss 应为可选项，并应编码为文本字符串。如果存在，签发方应要求其为两个大写字母，即 iss 和 DSC 的 X.509 C 属性中使用的 alpha-2 形式。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "Issuance SHALL be two-phase: prepare returns the exact bytes to sign (the Sig_structure), the caller signs them by any means, including asynchronous ones such as WebCrypto or a remote KMS, and finish assembles the certificate and returns the HC1 string and the COSE bytes. For ES256, finish SHALL accept r||s or DER and SHALL always emit r||s."
msgstr "签发应分两个阶段进行：prepare 返回待签名的确切字节（Sig_structure），调用方以任何方式对其签名，包括 WebCrypto 或远程 KMS 等异步方式，finish 则组装证书并返回 HC1 字符串和 COSE 字节。对于 ES256，finish 应接受 r||s 或 DER，并应始终输出 r||s。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "Issuer signing key"
msgstr "签发方签名密钥"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "It all followed him."
msgstr "一切都跟着他。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "It assembles the IPS and Somsak's DVCs."
msgstr "它汇编 IPS 和 Somsak 的 DVC。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "It builds a DVCMinPreQual payload: STT-PAY-001…005 and STT-PAY-007, with subclaim −6 (STT-SEL-003). No identity document is needed (STT-PAY-005)."
msgstr "它构建一个 DVCMinPreQual 载荷：STT-PAY-001…005 和 STT-PAY-007，使用子声明 −6（STT-SEL-003）。无需身份证件（STT-PAY-005）。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "It encrypts them (STT-VHL-004, STT-VHL-007) behind a passcode-protected manifest with an expiry (STT-VHL-009)."
msgstr "它对这些数据进行加密（STT-VHL-004、STT-VHL-007），置于一个受通行码保护且带有有效期的清单之后（STT-VHL-009）。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "It has XXR's key sign them (STT-COS-002, STT-COS-006), then finishes the HC1 text: STT-COS-001, STT-ZIP-001, STT-B45-001, STT-HC1-001, STT-QR-001."
msgstr "它让 XXR 的密钥对其签名（STT-COS-002、STT-COS-006），然后完成 HC1 文本：STT-COS-001、STT-ZIP-001、STT-B45-001、STT-HC1-001、STT-QR-001。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/how/fhir-r4/index.html:0
msgid "It is the common language. Every system in this story reads and writes the same resource shapes."
msgstr "它是通用语言。本故事中的每个系统都读写相同结构的资源。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/how/national-fhir/index.html:0
msgid "It is the one source of truth that the family wallet, clinics and VHL links all point back to."
msgstr "它是唯一的权威数据源，家庭钱包、诊所和 VHL 链接都指回它。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "It issues the link as an HCERT, with the VHL at key 5 (STT-VHL-001, STT-VHL-002), signed with Country B's DSC."
msgstr "它将该链接作为 HCERT 签发，VHL 位于键 5（STT-VHL-001、STT-VHL-002），并使用 B 国的 DSC 签名。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j1-born-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "It prepares the CWT and the bytes to sign: STT-CWT-001…005, STT-ISS-004."
msgstr "它准备 CWT 和待签名的字节：STT-CWT-001…005、STT-ISS-004。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/workshops/dpi-h-policy-track/how/family-wallet/index.html:0
msgid "It puts the family in control of sharing, on a device they already own."
msgstr "它让家庭在自己已有的设备上掌控共享。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "It requests the manifest by ITI-YY5, signed with HTTP Message Signatures (STT-VHL-005, STT-VHL-006, STT-VHL-008)."
msgstr "它通过 ITI-YY5 请求清单，并使用 HTTP 消息签名（HTTP Message Signatures）进行签名（STT-VHL-005、STT-VHL-006、STT-VHL-008）。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-1-full-history-abroad/index.html:0
msgid "It shows them to Dr Anan: every dose since the birth, viewed, never copied."
msgstr "它将这些内容展示给 Anan 医生：自出生以来的每一剂次，仅查看，从不复制。"

#: en/smart-trust-demo/journeys/smart-trust-demo/j4-0-one-family-one-phone/index.html:0
msgid "It’s on his phone. What if I travel without him?"
msgstr "记录在他的手机上。如果我不跟他一起出行怎么办？"

